  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Stablecoin printed metrics were roughly flat this week:</strong> Market Cap near $293.16B (+0.1% 30D) means crypto dollar liquidity did not re-price hard\u2014incremental demand is coming from product and banking-rail headlines rather than a market-cap surge. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/10/12/global-financial-watchdog-calls-for-cross-border-information-sharing-planning-for-stablecoin-crisis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Global financial watchdog calls for cross-border information sharing, planning for stablecoin crisis</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Stablecoin market structure remains concentration-led:</strong> leadership is still defined by a small set of large issuers/platforms; share shifts matter as much as aggregate market-cap growth. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/fsb-stablecoin-ai-risks-g20-finance-meeting?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Global watchdog flags stablecoin risks, AI threats ahead of G20</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li><li><strong>Policy and reserves are resetting issuer priorities:</strong> Issuer and platform share can shift before aggregate market cap does, because policy and reserve quality determine which names institutions will hold. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/10/12/south-korea-just-got-its-first-traditional-bank-loans-backed-by-bitcoin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">South Korea just got its first traditional bank loans backed by bitcoin</a> (CoinDesk).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
